{"id":"mount-roraima","name":"Mount Roraima","qid":"Q4777","country":"Brazil; Venezuela; Guyana","locality":"Bolívar, Uiramutã","lat":"5.141944444","lon":"-60.764166666","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"Proterozoic","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"mountain; tepui","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Roraima","text":"Mount Roraima (Spanish: Monte Roraima; Tepuy Roraima; Cerro Roraima; Portuguese: Monte Roraima) is the highest of the Pacaraima chain of tepuis (table-top mountain) or plateaux in South America. It is located at the junction of Brazil, Guyana and Venezuela. A characteristic, large, flat-topped mountain surrounded by cliffs 400–1,000 m (1,300–3,300 ft) high, its highest point is located on the southern edge of the cliff at an elevation of 2,810 m (9,220 ft) in Venezuela.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Roraima","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-e8b1f67738b0","w":1200,"h":634,"title":"Roraima3 (79).JPG","o":"gh-e8b1f67738b0.jpg","credit":{"text":"Paolo Costa Baldi","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Roraima3_%2879%29.JPG","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vi--mount-roraima","game":"civilization-vi","name":"Mount Roraima","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p1457cd0ec2b","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-p1457cd0ec2b.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Natural_Wonder_Mount_Roraima_closeup_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Xanthos of Thebes on 2018-04-30"}},{"id":"gh-p38c21666fd7","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-p38c21666fd7.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Natural_Wonder_Mount_